{"id":"apparence","lemma":"apparence","pos":"noun","rank":2566,"glosses":["appearance"],"ipa":"/a.pa.ʁɑ̃s/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/a/a4/Fr-apparence.ogg/Fr-apparence.ogg.mp3","gender":"f","forms":{"plural":"apparences"},"formAudio":{"apparences":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/0/0c/LL-Q150_%28fra%29-WikiLucas00-apparences.wav"},"examples":[{"text":"Aimes-tu ton apparence ?","en":"Do you like the way you look?","words":[{"g":"to love","l":"aimer"},{"g":"you"},{"g":"your"},null]},{"text":"Les apparences peuvent être trompeuses.","en":"Appearances can be deceiving.","words":[{"g":"the / them","l":"le"},null,{"g":"can, to be able to","l":"pouvoir"},{"g":"to be"},{"g":"deceitful","l":"trompeur"}]},{"text":"Son apparence m'a trompé.","en":"His appearance deceived me.","words":[{"g":"his, her, its"},null,{"g":"me"},{"g":"has","l":"avoir"},{"g":"to trick, dupe","l":"tromper"}]},{"text":"Elle a réussi à sauver les apparences.","en":"She managed to keep up appearances.","words":[{"g":"she / it"},{"g":"has","l":"avoir"},{"g":"to manage to do…","l":"réussir"},{"g":"to / at"},{"g":"to save, rescue"},{"g":"the / them","l":"le"},null]},{"text":"Je n'ai pas cette apparence.","en":"I don't look like that.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"not"},{"g":"have","l":"avoir"},{"g":"not"},{"g":"it, this, that","l":"ce"},null]}]}